{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（25日）下午2時17分，警方接報北角電氣道130至140號有石屎由高處墮下，擊中一名年約40多歲女途人。人員到場調查，事主腰部受傷，清醒送院治理。</p><p>現場大廈搭有棚架，警方正調查石屎墮下位置，暫未有人被捕。</p><figure><img alt=\"救護員替傷者包紮，稍後送院治理。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146828855214870528149350.jpeg/BPuID6oD1hd0oYiDbPLFvn8MsQyqaELTAuMuRCjjLkQ\"/><figcaption>救護員替傷者包紮，稍後送院治理。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護員替傷者包紮。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146828143957643264927364.jpeg/1OUMm4OVqS4ah4E8jAtA1TaO5V-gcDdaT0fAck9HwHI\"/><figcaption>救護員替傷者包紮。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146828141143134208327185.jpeg/I-JrfuZNavKT6dkPhIyiJeL-w__drQxosTE60LExOtA\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"對開大廈搭有棚架。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146828137594621952581406.jpeg/teC-SVjqCbkPcryWuxKi8uls8XJnwJf-XTce3V03Ht0\"/><figcaption>對開大廈搭有棚架。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-25T08:35:25.586791+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}